<title>TURKEY: Turkey sets 287-day t-bill auction for Friday.</title>
<headline>Turkey sets 287-day t-bill auction for Friday.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkish central bank said the Treasury would auction on Friday 287-day bills after Tuesday's auction where it sold 196.4 trillion lira of 287-day bills at 96.47 percent yield.</p>
<p>    Maturity    : November 26, 1997</p>
<p>    Amount	: -</p>
<p>    Coupon	: -</p>
<p>Auction date: February 7, 1997</p>
<p>Value date  : February 12, 1997</p>
<p>Turkish markets will close on Friday for a Moslem holiday and reopen on February 12, Wednesday when the Treasury has to repay 105.3 trillion lira of domestic debt.</p>
<p>-- Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
